  "summary": "Outlook-inspired Synapp calendar workspace with deterministic Wasm planning tools.",
  "description": "First-party Synapp calendar app. The React UI is the human calendar workspace for calendar views, event editing, scheduling assistant, invitations, categories, sharing, delegates, subscriptions, reminders, settings, offline state, and audit projections. The Wasm module is a pure planner and validator; host services own persistence, invites, contacts, free/busy, rooms, reminders, conference links, sharing, subscriptions, offline cache, and audit.",
